<PageLayout title="Why Local — TotalRecalls" description="Durability, portability, independence, backups, privacy." breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Compare", href: "/compare/" }, { label: "Why Local" }]}>
  <h1>Why Local Wins</h1>
  <p>Your conversations are your most valuable context. Here's why keeping them local matters:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Durability.</strong> If a provider shuts down or suspends your account, your data vanishes—unless it's local.</li>
    <li><strong>Portability.</strongstrong> Move your library to any drive, cloud, or new computer at any time.</li>
    <li><strong>Independence.</strongstrong> No vendor lock-in. No account recovery hell.</li>
    <li><strong>Backups.</strongstrong> Your library syncs to any backup tool you choose.</li>
    <li><strong>Privacy.</strongstrong> We never host your tokens, your chats, or your session data.</li>
  </ul>
</PageLayout>
